<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="28563383"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1507333089"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="AMAZING ME"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="WHITE JAM"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TIK TOK"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:31.981"><div begin="00:00.000" end="03:31.087"><p begin="00:00.000" end="00:04.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I wanna touch and I wanna kiss<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想触碰，我想吻你</span></p><p begin="00:04.337" end="00:09.055" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">But I've got go 忘れてないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管离开,但不想忘记</span></p><p begin="00:09.055" end="00:13.412" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">思い出せない 君のことが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却也回想不起</span></p><p begin="00:13.936" end="00:18.217" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">But I understand (stand) stand (stand) stand<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是我明白,知道..</span></p><p begin="00:17.647" end="00:18.473" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Let's go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感动(去吧,去吧,我将放你自由)</span></p><p begin="00:18.217" end="00:22.796" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">AMAZING ME, AMAZING ME</p><p begin="00:19.844" end="00:23.465" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">(Go, go, just get a life, go)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感动(去吧,去吧,我将放你自由)</span></p><p begin="00:22.796" end="00:27.406" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">夜空にせがむよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着夜空请求</span></p><p begin="00:24.450" end="00:27.958" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">(Go, go, just get a life, go)</p><p begin="00:27.752" end="00:32.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">とめどない思い出 辿って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沿循无止境的回忆</span></p><p begin="00:32.097" end="00:36.549" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">諦められずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直无法放弃</span></p><p begin="00:33.645" end="00:35.284" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">(Go, go)</p><p begin="00:36.777" end="00:41.228" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">AMAZING ME<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感动(去吧,去吧,我将放你自由)</span></p><p begin="00:38.107" end="00:41.809" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">(Go, go, just get a life, go)</p><p begin="00:41.247" end="00:46.162" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">AMAZING ME<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感动(去吧,去吧,我将放你自由)</span></p><p begin="00:42.769" end="00:46.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">(Go, go, go, just get a life, go)</p><p begin="00:46.935" end="00:48.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">ここから眺めた君が遠い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从这里望去你是如此遥远</span></p><p begin="00:49.093" end="00:50.519" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">ネックレスはあいつとお揃い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">项链和那家伙的是同款的</span></p><p begin="00:51.345" end="00:53.377" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">はじめっから知ってた君の想い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从一开始就知道你心中所想</span></p><p begin="00:53.499" end="00:55.546" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">だけど信じた 叶わない未来<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却依然坚信不会实现的未来</span></p><p begin="00:56.328" end="00:57.743" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">霞んでくおととい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐朦胧的前天</span></p><p begin="00:57.990" end="01:00.024" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">楽しい記憶もゴミ箱にポイ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快乐的记忆也丢进垃圾箱里</span></p><p begin="01:00.558" end="01:02.523" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">それとももう一度君のもと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却还是要再次回到你身边？</span></p><p begin="01:02.370" end="01:04.611" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">No, no 今頃言ってももう遅い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">事到如今这样说已经迟了</span></p><p begin="01:04.611" end="01:08.407" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">I wanna touch and I wanna kiss<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想触碰,我想吻你</span></p><p begin="01:08.793" end="01:13.267" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">But I've got go 忘れてないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管离开,但不想忘记</span></p><p begin="01:13.384" end="01:17.233" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">思い出せない 君のことが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却也回想不起</span></p><p begin="01:18.012" end="01:22.271" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">But I understand (stand) stand (stand) stand<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是我明白,知道..</span></p><p begin="01:21.815" end="01:22.502" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Let's go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感动(去吧,去吧,我将放你自由)</span></p><p begin="01:22.465" end="01:26.472" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">AMAZING ME, AMAZING ME</p><p begin="01:23.939" end="01:27.413" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">(Go, go, just get a life, go)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感动(去吧,去吧,我将放你自由)</span></p><p begin="01:26.472" end="01:30.854" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">夜空にせがむよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着夜空请求</span></p><p begin="01:28.560" end="01:31.964" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">(Go, go, just get a life, go)</p><p begin="01:30.854" end="01:36.062" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">とめどない思い出 辿って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沿循无止境的回忆</span></p><p begin="01:36.154" end="01:40.683" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">諦められずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直无法放弃</span></p><p begin="01:37.564" end="01:39.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">(Go, go)</p><p begin="01:40.264" end="01:45.164" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">AMAZING ME<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感动(去吧,去吧,我将放你自由)</span></p><p begin="01:42.128" end="01:46.476" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">(Go, go, just get a life, go, let go)</p><p begin="01:45.313" end="01:49.622" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">AMAZING ME<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感动(去吧,去吧,我将放你自由)</span></p><p begin="01:46.733" end="01:50.273" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">(Go, go, go, go, just get a life, go)</p><p begin="01:51.097" end="01:53.741" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">またふたりに再会の時がきても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算未来两人还能再相见</span></p><p begin="01:53.662" end="01:55.557" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">その愛の言葉は Copy and Paste<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那话语一定像复制粘贴一样</span></p><p begin="01:56.151" end="01:57.824" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">きっと誰かに言ったセリフ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾对别人说过</span></p><p begin="01:57.915" end="02:00.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">誰かにした Kiss がいつもの Trick<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对谁的亲吻</span></p><p begin="02:00.472" end="02:02.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">支離滅裂の決別が来るなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是迎来支离破碎的诀别</span></p><p begin="02:02.804" end="02:05.119" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">別々のままでいるのがベスト<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">各自做好自己才是最好的</span></p><p begin="02:05.341" end="02:06.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">でも待ち続けたレスポンス<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但那是我等待已久的回答</span></p><p begin="02:06.997" end="02:09.442" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">But stop, 'cause I gotta let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是算了吧,我必须放手</span></p><p begin="02:08.509" end="02:12.283" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">I wanna touch and I wanna kiss<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想触碰,我想吻你</span></p><p begin="02:12.760" end="02:17.163" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">But I've got go 忘れたいのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管离开,但不想忘记</span></p><p begin="02:17.426" end="02:21.494" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">鳴った携帯 取り留めない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">响起的手机</span></p><p begin="02:22.202" end="02:26.148" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">奇跡を Oh (Still) Oh (Still) Oh (Still)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不可能实现的奇迹</span></p><p begin="02:26.148" end="02:30.693" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">AMAZING ME<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感动</span></p><p begin="02:27.615" end="02:29.523" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">あの日何ができたとか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一天</span></p><p begin="02:29.881" end="02:31.856" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">あの日何が言えたとか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一天</span></p><p begin="02:32.099" end="02:35.327" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">何度二倍再生の日々 思い返したって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无数次两倍再生的每一天</span></p><p begin="02:35.770" end="02:36.557" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">意味はない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也没有意义</span></p><p begin="02:36.698" end="02:38.819" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">ふたり あの頃に戻れたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人</span></p><p begin="02:38.963" end="02:40.929" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">ふたり お互いを許せたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人</span></p><p begin="02:41.353" end="02:44.585" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">一生の約束なんて言葉は 嘘に変わって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一生的约定之类的话语</span></p><p begin="02:44.784" end="02:46.157" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">何度も Let go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无数次</span></p><p begin="02:45.114" end="02:48.848" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">I wanna touch and I wanna kiss<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想触碰,我想吻你</span></p><p begin="02:49.368" end="02:53.652" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">But I've got go 忘れてないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管离开,但不想忘记</span></p><p begin="02:53.938" end="02:58.003" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">思い出せない 君のことが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却也回想不起</span></p><p begin="02:58.490" end="03:02.429" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">But I understand (stand) stand (stand) stand<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是我明白,知道..</span></p><p begin="03:02.303" end="03:03.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">Let's go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感动(去吧,去吧,我将放你自由)</span></p><p begin="03:03.049" end="03:07.189" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67">AMAZING ME, AMAZING ME</p><p begin="03:04.450" end="03:08.001" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68">(Go, go, just get a life, go)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感动(去吧,去吧,我将放你自由)</span></p><p begin="03:07.189" end="03:12.018" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L69">夜空にせがむよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着夜空请求</span></p><p begin="03:09.092" end="03:12.576" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L70">(Go, go, just get a life, go)</p><p begin="03:12.018" end="03:16.628" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L71">とめどない思い出 辿って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沿循无止境的回忆</span></p><p begin="03:16.690" end="03:21.272" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L72">諦められずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直无法放弃</span></p><p begin="03:18.213" end="03:19.913" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L73">(Go, go)</p><p begin="03:21.369" end="03:25.632" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L74">AMAZING ME<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感动(去吧,去吧,我将放你自由)</span></p><p begin="03:22.743" end="03:26.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L75">(Go, go, just get a life, go)</p><p begin="03:25.919" end="03:29.631" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L76">AMAZING ME<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感动(去吧,去吧,我将放你自由)</span></p><p begin="03:27.351" end="03:31.087" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L77">(Go, go, just get a life, go)</p></div></body></tt>